{"version":1,"slug":"Others__Odd_One_Out_02_(20Q)","path":"Others/Odd One Out 02 (20Q).html","title":"devgagan","provider":"Others","category":"Odd One Out 02 (20Q).html","durationMinutes":60,"totalQuestions":20,"sectionsLocked":false,"sections":null,"questions":[{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Find the odd one out</p><p></p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2357;&#2367;&#2359;&#2350; &#2325;&#2379; &#2346;&#2361;&#2330;&#2366;&#2344;&#2375;&#2306;</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">Famous</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2360;&#2367;&#2342;&#2381;&#2343;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Notorious</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2325;&#2369;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2340;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Distinguished</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2357;&#2367;&#2358;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2335;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Noted</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2357;&#2367;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2340;</span>"],"correct_option_id":1,"solution":"<p>B is the odd one out. The others are synonymous.</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Find the odd one out</p><p></p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2357;&#2367;&#2359;&#2350; &#2325;&#2379; &#2346;&#2361;&#2330;&#2366;&#2344;&#2375;&#2306;</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">Channel</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2330;&#2376;&#2344;&#2354;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Canal</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2344;&#2361;&#2352;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Path</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2346;&#2341;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Rout</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2346;&#2352;&#2366;&#2332;&#2351;</span>"],"correct_option_id":3,"solution":"<p>Rout means defeat. The other options are synonyms.</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt