ay:none\"><p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2358;&#2381;&#2344; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2330;&#2366;&#2352; &#2358;&#2348;&#2381;&#2342; &#2342;&#2367;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;, &#2332;&#2367;&#2344;&#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2340;&#2368;&#2344; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360;&#2368; &#2340;&#2352;&#2361; &#2360;&#2375; &#2360;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;, &#2332;&#2348;&#2325;&#2367; &#2330;&#2380;&#2341;&#2366; &#2349;&#2367;&#2344;&#2381;&#2344; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2357;&#2361; &#2358;&#2348;&#2381;&#2342; &#2330;&#2369;&#2344;&#2375;&#2306; &#2332;&#2379; &#2348;&#2366;&#2325;&#2368; &#2360;&#2375; &#2309;&#2354;&#2327; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">Fad</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2360;&#2344;&#2325;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Craze</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2360;&#2344;&#2325;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Trend</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2352;&#2369;&#2333;&#2366;&#2344;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Tradition</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2346;&#2352;&#2306;&#2346;&#2352;&#2366;</span>"],"correct_option_id":3,"solution":"<p>Fad, craze, and trend mean short-lived enthusiasm for something that usually does not last long. Tradition means the opposite of these words as it is something that has been followed by many generations over the years.</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Four words have been given out of which three are alike in some manner and one is different. Select the word that is different.</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2330;&#2366;&#2352; &#2358;&#2348;&#2381;&#2342; &#2342;&#2367;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;, &#2332;&#2367;&#2344;&#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2340;&#2368;&#2344; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360;&#2368; &#2344; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360;&#